abstract: >
  Curated support bundle for reproducing the Paper 24 v3.0 lithium calculation
  chain, including the Pastore ground-state quadrupole import, Henderson
  excited-state import recomputation, transition quadrupole projection,
  R4/FIRAS non-entry audit, frozen outputs, and validation scripts.
